  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Genderstatistics 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genderstatistik 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SCB och Goskomstat forts&#xE4;tter fram till slutet av 2000 att introducera genderstatistik i Ryssland. Projektm&#xE5;let f&#xF6;r denna fas &#xE4;r att s&#xE4;tta upp en fungerande organisation f&#xF6;r produktion och spridning av genderstatistik p&#xE5; den regionala statistikkommitt&#xE9;n i 8 nya ryska regioner + p&#xE5; den federala myndigheten Goskomstat.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Until the end of year 2000, Statistics Sweden and Goskomstat will continue to cooperate on introducing gender statistics in Russia. The project objective is to set up a functioning organization for production and dissemination of gender statistics at the Regional Statistical Committees in 8 new regions and at the federal authority</narrative>
  </description>
